OL,3,AChrista Pike's lawyers in court after
OL,4,Afailed execution of US death row inmate
OL,5,
OL,6,FPike's lawyers say she is now
OL,7,F"conscious and speaking" and continues
OL,8,Fto receive care after surviving two
OL,9,Flethal doses of the drug pentobarbital
OL,10,F- read more about what this is
OL,12,FPike was sentenced to death following
OL,13,Fher conviction for murdering Colleen
OL,14,FSlemmer in 1995
OL,16,FLater: Her legal team are set to give a
OL,17,Fnews conference following today's court
OL,18,Fhearing
